Package: scpPower
Title: Calibration and Simulation for Single-Cell Proteomics Design
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Youshan", "Heng", email = "poggar@hotmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2758-171X"))
Description: Estimates protein-level cell and acquisition-batch variance,
    intensity-dependent quantification probabilities, and identifier-mapped
    between-donor variance from independent bulk proteomics. Returns explicit
    reasons for unavailable components and records software versions, input
    hashes, seeds, and run time. Implements the calibration stage of a
    registered single-cell proteomics design workflow. Simulates hierarchical
    log2 measurements with dataset-specific missingness and acquisition layouts.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: digest, lme4, stats, utils, yaml
Suggests: BiocManager, edgeR, ExperimentHub, jsonlite, limma, QFeatures,
    readxl, renv, roxygen2, scp, scpdata, SummarizedExperiment, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/yhengaa/scpPower
BugReports: https://github.com/yhengaa/scpPower/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
